 2 | SELECT g, k FROM pa ORDER BY g DESC, k DESC                 | 11676 | t     |             1 |     0
 3 | SELECT g, k FROM pa WHERE g BETWEEN 10 AND 30 ORDER BY g, k |  6283 | t     |             1 |     0
(3 rows)

ROLLBACK;
SELECT n, q, (pa_check(q)).* FROM pa_q WHERE n IN (1, 2, 3) ORDER BY n;
 n |                              q                              | rows  | agree | ordered_scans | sorts 
---+-------------------------------------------------------------+-------+-------+---------------+-------
